{"resourceType":"Questionnaire","id":"ID-1725564827","title":"Other","name":"Other","status":"active","publisher":"www.intelehealth.org","language":"en","item":[{"linkId":"ID-965073007","text":"Describe the patient's complaint in his/her words as best as you can* - [Describe]","type":"string","required":true,"_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"or"},{"url":"content","valueString":"ରୋଗୀ ପୁରୁଷ /ସ୍ତ୍ରୀ ଯେଉଁ ଭାଷାରେ କହିଲା ସେହି ଭାଷାରେ ବର୍ଣନା କର* - (ବର୍ଣନା କର)"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"hi"},{"url":"content","valueString":"रोगी की शिकायत का जहाँ तक  हो सके उसके शब्दों मे वर्णन करें* - [वर्णन करें]"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"gu"},{"url":"content","valueString":"દર્દીની ફરિયાદને શક્ય એટલી તેમના શબ્દોમાં વર્ણવો* - [વિગતે જણાવો]"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"as"},{"url":"content","valueString":"ৰোগীৰ অভিযোগে বর্ণনা তাৰ কথাত যিমান টা সম্ভব পাৰে তাৰ বর্ণনা কৰা* - [বর্ণনা কৰা]"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"bn"},{"url":"content","valueString":"রোগীর অভিযোগ তার কথায় যতটা সম্ভব বর্ণনা করুন* - [বর্ণনা]"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"kn"},{"url":"content","valueString":"ರೋಗಿಯ ದೂರನ್ನು ಅವನ/ಆಕೆಯ ಮಾತುಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ನಿಮಗೆ ಸಾಧ್ಯವಾದಷ್ಟು ಉತ್ತಮವಾಗಿ ವಿವರಿಸಿ* - [ವಿವರಿಸಿ]"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"mr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"रुग्णाच्या तक्रारीचे त्याच्या/तिच्या शब्दात वर्णन करा - [वर्णन करा]"}]}]},"extension":[{"url":"https://intelehealth.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/language","valueString":"%"}]},{"linkId":"ID-314961968","text":"Prior treatment sought","type":"choice","required":true,"_text":{"extension":[{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"or"},{"url":"content","valueString":"ତମେ ଆଗରୁ କୌଣସି  ପ୍ରାକାର ଔଷଦ ନଇଥିଲ କି? (ନିଜେ ସ୍ୱାସ୍ଥ୍ୟ ଏବଂ ଘରୋଇ ଉପଚାର)*"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"hi"},{"url":"content","valueString":"आपने आज यहाँ आने के पहले किसी स्वास्थ्यकर्मी से मुलाकात की है या स्वयं कोई उपचार किया है [घरेलू दवाई समेत ]*"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"gu"},{"url":"content","valueString":"આજે અહીં આવવા પહેલાં તમે કોઇ ઉપચાર (પોતે જાતે જ દવાઓ લેવી અથવા ઘરેલુ ઉપાયો) કર્યો છે અથવા કોઇ આરોગ્યકર્મી (હેલ્થ પ્રોવાઇડર)ને મળ્યા છો?*"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"as"},{"url":"content","valueString":"আজি ইয়াত আহা আগতে আপুনি কি কোনো চিকিৎসা কৰিছিলে (স্ব-ঔষধ বা ঘৰোৱা প্রতিকাৰ সহ ) বা কোনো স্বাস্থ্য সৰবৰাহকাৰীক এই সমস্যাৰ বিষযে দেখোছিলে ?*"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"bn"},{"url":"content","valueString":"আজ এখানে আসার আগে আপনি কি কোনো চিকিৎসা নিয়েছেন (স্ব-ওষুধ বা ঘরোয়া প্রতিকার সহ) বা এই সমস্যার জন্য কোনো স্বাস্থ্য প্রদানকারীকে দেখেছেন?*"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"kn"},{"url":"content","valueString":"ಇಂದು ಇಲ್ಲಿಗೆ ಬರುವ ಮೊದಲು ನೀವು ಯಾವುದೇ ಚಿಕಿತ್ಸೆಯನ್ನು (ಸ್ವಯಂ-ಔಷಧಿ ಅಥವಾ ಮನೆಮದ್ದುಗಳನ್ನು ಒಳಗೊಂಡಂತೆ) ತೆಗೆದುಕೊಂಡಿದ್ದೀರಾ ಅಥವಾ ಈ ಸಮಸ್ಯೆಗೆ ಯಾವುದೇ ಆರೋಗ್ಯ ಪೂರೈಕೆದಾರರನ್ನು ನೋಡಿದ್ದೀರಾ?*"}]},{"url":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/translation","extension":[{"url":"lang","valueCode":"mr"},{"url":"content","valueString":"आज येथे येण्यापूर्वी तुम्ही या समस्येसाठी कोणतेही उपचार (स्वयं-उपचार किंवा घरगुती उपचारांसह) घेतले आहेत किंवा कोणत्याही डॉक्टरला दाखवले होते का?"}]}]},"extension":[{"url":"https://intelehealth.org/fh